✅ Start / Stop SAP
Bash
sapcontrol -nr <instance_no> -function Start
sapcontrol -nr <instance_no> -function Stop
✅ Check SAP Status
Bash
sapcontrol -nr <instance_no> -function GetProcessList
✅ SAP Environment
Bash
su - <sid>adm
env | grep SAP
✅ Logs
Bash
cd /usr/sap/<SID>/DVEBMGS<instance>/work
tail -f dev_w0
